{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>想專心工作或讀書，卻總被社交與遊戲應用拉走注意力？NoxPlain Detox 讓你自行挑選要封鎖的應用，設定遠離手機的時長，按住 Detox 按鈕即可展開專注時段，適合學生、在家工作者與需要深度專注的人。應用原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>自訂時段封鎖分心應用</h2>\n<p>透過 Apple 的螢幕使用時間控制選取要封鎖的應用，設定時段後按住 Detox 按鈕即可開始，期間應用會持續被封鎖。你也可建立可重用的預設組合，在開始前規劃待辦事項並於期間逐一勾選，順道記錄突發念頭。完成時段可累積分數，結束前與完成後均會收到通知，介面簡潔，所有資料只儲存在裝置本機。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-270-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-271-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-272-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-273-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-274-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1320x2868bb-275-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：NoxPlain Detox</li>\n<li>應用類別：Productivity</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-18T00:38:18.419321+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":332,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}